<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span><span id="A4.T11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Comparison of downstream performance of different approaches under data scarcity across NER sub-tasks.</span> The evaluation metric is F1. The data portion indicates the percentage of the original training data used for fine-tuning. The best results are shown in bold.</figcaption>
